{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"1661b46cec2f2015f2acb8a7756a38801c4ffbc73680b44efcb2f0721d7143df","ja":"可奈までも？","zh":"连可奈也？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"049b18b4a3b55fccec8a9c4ea3799f5a9327c5557ce61322b7c140f2882ae28c","ja":"数日後。とあるお仕事が終わり、\n紬が少し遅れて楽屋に向かっていたら……","zh":"几天后。结束了一份工作，  \n纺稍微晚了一点前往休息室时……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c22276dfadccee23e7121d6e5547048771dba3c92ef8b816b5c67228855c2d61","ja":"あ、次のバス3分後だって！　走れば間に合いそう～！\n紬ちゃん、お疲れさま～！","zh":"啊，下一班公交车还有3分钟！跑过去的话好像能赶上～！\n紬，辛苦啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fd7045c3c180c223d68daba75d8cc48650f34690e5aa10ecf854d3b25ae61690","ja":"お疲れさまでした～！","zh":"辛苦啦～！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"663ffdc33c2ebe042a27e9561d5535c0188ec511b2671c1a5c2f2f9ee4a30d54","ja":"は、はい、お疲れさ……\nま、またあっという間に行ってしまいました……。","zh":"好、好的，辛苦了……\n又、又一下子就走掉了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"806e6813514f58b7cd6f61615cb234f6eef3b2e208848273e6b085ad97694a8b","ja":"あの、春日さんだけではなく、\n矢吹さんまで様子がおかしくありませんか？","zh":"那个，不只是春日小姐，连矢吹小姐的样子也很奇怪吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"08d647e91bb9ccee6d40e6522123f9d8953537b9817497a36e412d3d9bb257a6","ja":"うん……。可奈、今度のお仕事の台本も……\n置き忘れて、帰っちゃったし……。","zh":"嗯……可奈也把这次工作的剧本……忘在那里就回去了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d55693335586a53c64ac66ffc00778cdcb2aa1ad4c607d27b81a29454355d633","ja":"今日の、可奈……未来と、\nおんなじ感じ……だったね……。","zh":"今天的可奈……和未来，\n感觉一样……呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"17dfbbbc962bc2c6945b47fa5797cbd162bbccf175bb665e51ed5a74667006ff","ja":"はい。春日さんにお話を聞くと言ってから、\n矢吹さんまでソワソワし始めて……。","zh":"好的。说要去听春日小姐讲述之后，连矢吹小姐也开始坐立不安了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8bf06138963bd5f8388901a1aa5d7e75bfe322983476be588ccc6def8ba9b23e","ja":"まっ、まさか！？　春日さんはよからぬことに\n巻き込まれているのでは！？　それで矢吹さんも……！","zh":"难、难道说！？春日小姐被卷入了什么不好的事情！？所以矢吹小姐也……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d02b4422e9f1ecea066053ff91fd0c7c893f9edb2ff42256eebb19369d3a29c0","ja":"わからない、けど……。\n杏奈も……気になってきた、かも……。","zh":"不知道，但是……\n杏奈也……开始有点在意了，可能……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4f2c1521f006bda19e8a3f08b276e5b4d993450cc779387faa4644f1da2cbe4f","ja":"私もますます気になりました。ですが、\n話を聞こうにも、おふたりとも捕まりませんし……。","zh":"我也越来越在意了。不过，就算想听听情况，也联系不上你们两位……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f17324634c71dc5b95850410dc4556bc4d824a321b42258381d187bba507368e","ja":"なら……逃げられないように、すれば……いいかも。\n杏奈、いいこと思いついた……よ。","zh":"那么……想办法让它逃不掉……或许就行了。\n杏奈想到个好主意……哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1799.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3b912b006fbb99174a3a0ed4af86a52d5aedb6e545995da02b07b574f2626a4e","ja":"本当ですか！　ぜひお聞かせください！","zh":"真的吗！请务必告诉我！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
